# 7. Feature Tree Level 2 — Core MVP

Nếu đi sâu một level, tôi sẽ ưu tiên như sau:

```text
D · VLEARN
│
├── Lesson Integration
│   ├── Get current lesson
│   ├── Get transcript
│   └── Get learning objectives
│
├── Teaching Session
│   ├── Create session
│   ├── Resume session
│   ├── Track progress
│   └── Complete session
│
├── Knowledge Chunking
│   ├── Extract concepts
│   ├── Create chunks
│   ├── Define required knowledge
│   └── Define quality bar
│
├── Teaching Loop ★ CORE
│   ├── Prompt student
│   ├── Receive explanation
│   ├── Analyze explanation
│   ├── Detect knowledge gap
│   ├── Generate targeted question
│   ├── Receive clarification
│   └── Re-evaluate
│
├── Validation
│   ├── Source grounding
│   ├── Accuracy
│   ├── Completeness
│   └── Pass / Retry
│
├── Progress
│   ├── Chunk status
│   ├── Loop count
│   └── Overall progress
│
└── Result
    ├── Learning summary
    ├── Weak points
    └── Continue to quiz
```

**★ Teaching Loop là feature trung tâm**, không phải Chat UI.

